{% set applicant = frappe.get_doc("Job Applicant", doc.job_applicant) if doc.job_applicant else none %}

{% set offer_name = frappe.db.get_value(
    "Job Offer",
    {"job_applicant": doc.job_applicant},
    "name"
) if doc.job_applicant else none %}

{% set offer = frappe.get_doc("Job Offer", offer_name) if offer_name else none %}

{% set joining_date = offer.custom_joining_date if offer else none %}
{% set designation = offer.designation if offer and offer.designation else "" %}
{% set applicant_name = applicant.applicant_name if applicant else "" %}
{% set employee_code = doc.custom_employee if doc.custom_employee else "" %}
{% set salary_amount = (doc.custom_monthly_gross_salary | float) if doc.custom_monthly_gross_salary else 0 %}

{% set annexure = frappe.get_doc("Salary Annexure", doc.custom_salary_annexure) if doc.custom_salary_annexure else none %}

{# ===== TUNING: page 1 container height (px) ===== #}
{% set page1_h = 1035 %}

{{ letter_head }}

<style>
.hirakud-letter {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    text-align: justify;
}

.hirakud-letter p {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
}

.hirakud-point {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.hirakud-annexure {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.hirakud-annexure table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    table-layout: fixed;
}

.hirakud-annexure th,
.hirakud-annexure td {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 6px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

.hirakud-annexure th {
    text-align: center;
}

.hirakud-annexure .total-row td {
    background-color: #e5e5e5;
    font-weight: bold;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.hirakud-annexure .amount-cell {
    text-align: right;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.hirakud-annexure .component-cell {
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
    word-wrap: break-word;
}

.hirakud-annexure .spacer-row td {
    height: 28px;
    background-color: #e5e5e5;
}

.hirakud-terms {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
}

.hirakud-signatory {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
}

@media print {
    .hirakud-annexure-page {
        page-break-before: always;
    }

    .hirakud-annexure tr {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
}
</style>

<!-- ================= APPOINTMENT LETTER : PAGE 1 (Date se point 10 tak) ================= -->

<div class="hirakud-letter">

<p style="text-align:left;">
Date: {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(joining_date, "dd/MM/yyyy") if joining_date else "" }}</p>

<br>

<p>
To,<br>
{{ applicant_name }}<br>
Hindalco Industries Ltd.<br>
Hirakud, Sambalpur, Odisha-768016.
</p>

<br>

<div style="position:relative; height:{{ page1_h }}px; box-sizing:border-box;">

<p>
Sub: Letter of Appointment for the Position of <b>"{{ designation }}" </b>at the Company’s Client location.
</p>

<br>

<p>Dear {{ applicant_name }},</p>

<p>
With reference to your application for an employment in our organization and the subsequent discussions you had with us, we are pleased to appoint you in the services of M/s. Vaaman Engineers India Limited (the Company) as a <b>"{{ designation }}"</b> at the Company’s Client location M/s. Hindalco Industries Ltd, Hirakud, Odisha Site with effect from <b> {{ frappe.utils.formatdate(joining_date, "dd.MM.yyyy") if joining_date else "" }}.</b> The terms and conditions of your employment with the Company will be as under:
</p>

<br>

<p class="hirakud-point">
<b>1.</b> You will be paid a consolidated Salary of Rs. <b>{{ "{:,.0f}".format(salary_amount) }}</b>/- per month, subject to statutory deductions as applicable from time to time, and your salary revision will happen as per the Company Policy and the revision/renewal of the Company’s business contract with the Client.
</p>
<br>

<p class="hirakud-point">
<b>2.</b> Your employment with the company is subject to you being found medically fit, and continue to remain fit during the course of your employment (as per the Client’s Health check-up) and the satisfactory verification of your antecedents (as provided by you to the Company in its Employment Form) and the educational testimonials. In case any discrepancy is found in any of the above, the management may initiate appropriate action against you for such false declaration, including termination of your services.
</p>
<br>

<p class="hirakud-point">
<b>3.</b> You shall be governed by the service Rules &amp; Regulations and policies of the Company that are in force or will be introduced and/or modified from time to time, and any amendment or modification thereto shall be binding on you.
</p>
<br>

<p class="hirakud-point">
<b>4.</b> Your employment with the Company will be transferable and the Company reserves the right to transfer your services to any other location or Group Company or where any of its associates have their establishments or may set up new establishments.
</p>
<br>

<p class="hirakud-point">
<b>5.</b> Your services are liable to be terminated without assigning any reason thereof by giving you notice or notice pay in lieu of notice as applicable to your category. In case you wish to resign from the services of the Company, the management reserves the right to accept your resignation with effect from such date as it may deem fit considering the criticality of the position you are handling and the prevailing business exigencies.
</p>
<br>

<p class="hirakud-point">
